OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GThe plainsong-inspired theme
OL,6,     Gcontinues with highlights from
OL,7,     GMonteverdi's Vespers of 1610 in a
OL,8,     Gspecially made recording from
OL,9,     GMonaco, plus Chopin, Schumann and
OL,10,     GFalla from Perth.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gershwin
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod tells the story of
OL,13,     GGeorge Gershwin's first
OL,14,     Gexperience of working in
OL,15,     GHollywood.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPianist Edward Leung performs
OL,18,     Glive in the studio and we talk to
OL,19,     GMark Ravenhill on directing a new
OL,20,     Gproduction of Salome by Regents
OL,21,     GOpera.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
