OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 9 APR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GFrom Birmingham, the CBSO plays
OL,10,     GRachmaninov's Rhapsody on a theme
OL,11,     Gof Paganini with pianist Nelson
OL,12,     GGoerner, alongside music by
OL,13,     GHindemith and Bartok's Concerto
OL,14,     Gfor Orchestra.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Healing Musicians
OL,16,     GKate Kennedy meets Ludwig Quandt,
OL,17,     Gprincipal cellist of the Berlin
OL,18,     GPhilharmonic, to discover how an
OL,19,     Gunexpected injury forced him to
OL,20,     Grethink his life and career.
